{"acceptance_length": 8.508196721311476, "acceptance_lengths": [2, 6, 16, 16, 11, 2, 5, 5, 16, 4, 1, 3, 9, 13, 7, 9, 1, 3, 16, 16, 16, 2, 16, 3, 3, 8, 16, 16, 16, 11, 12, 7, 2, 11, 7, 4, 1, 3, 14, 3, 2, 2, 3, 2, 6, 2, 4, 6, 16, 15, 7, 14, 2, 13, 5, 8, 16, 16, 16, 16, 16], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 21690740736, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 21690735616, "benchmark": "math500", "completion": "We are given the set of integers from 1 to 100:\n\n$$\n\\{1, 2, 3, \\ldots, 100\\}\n$$\n\nWe are to find the **probability** that a randomly selected integer from this set is **divisible by 2** and **not divisible by 3**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Total number of integers\n\nThere are:\n\n$$\n100 \\text{ integers in total}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Count the numbers divisible by 2\n\nA number is divisible by 2 if it is even.\n\nThe even numbers from 1 to 100 are:\n\n$$\n2, 4, 6, \\ldots, 100\n$$\n\nThis is an arithmetic sequence with:\n\n- First term $ a = 2 $\n- Last term $ l = 100 $\n- Common difference $ d = 2 $\n\nThe number of terms is:\n\n$$\nn = \\frac{l - a}{d} + 1 = \\frac{100 - 2}{2} + 1 = \\frac{98}{2} + 1 = 49 + 1 = 50\n$$\n\nSo, there are **50 numbers divisible by 2**.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: From these 50 numbers, count how many are **not divisible by 3**\n\nWe now want to count how many of the **even numbers** (i.e., divisible by 2) are **not divisible by 3**.\n\nLet\u2019s find how many of the even numbers are divisible by both 2 and 3 \u2014 that is, divisible by the **least common multiple (LCM)** of 2 and 3.\n\n$$\n\\text{LCM}(2, 3) = 6\n$$\n\nSo, we want to count how many numbers from 1 to 100 are divisible by 6.\n\nThese are:\n\n$$\n6, 12, 18, \\ldots, 96\n$$\n\nThis is an arithmetic sequence with:\n\n- First term $ a = 6 $\n- Last term $ l = 96 $\n- Common difference $ d = 6 $\n\nNumber of terms:\n\n$$\nn = \\frac{l - a}{d} + 1 = \\frac{96 - 6}{6} + 1 = \\frac{90}{", "decode_seconds": 2.4740960858762264, "draft_calls": 61, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 78, "method": "native_target_dflash", "output_hash": "9157bc46171d3f353422df0b4a62f96a1fc8e02cddc676d0f0b609356742f471", "output_tokens": 512, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 21847635968, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 22110273536, "problem_id": "math500/162", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 2530.246824026108}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "\\dfrac{17}{50}", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 2.530246824026108, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 22110273536, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 22110273536, "target_calls": 61, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.047073840629309416, "turn_index": 0}
